---
const repo = "jyhs-coderix/jyhs-coderix.github.io";
const repoId = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GISCUS_REPO_ID;
const category = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GISCUS_CATEGORY ?? "General";
const categoryId = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GISCUS_CATEGORY_ID;
---

<section class="comments" aria-label="댓글">
  <h2>댓글</h2>
  {
    repoId && categoryId ? (
      <script
        is:inline
        src="https://giscus.app/client.js"
        data-repo={repo}
        data-repo-id={repoId}
        data-category={category}
        data-category-id={categoryId}
        data-mapping="pathname"
        data-strict="0"
        data-reactions-enabled="1"
        data-emit-metadata="0"
        data-input-position="bottom"
        data-theme="light"
        data-lang="ko"
        crossorigin="anonymous"
        async
      />
    ) : (
      <p class="empty">
        Giscus 설정 후 댓글이 표시됩니다. 저장소 Discussions를 켜고
        <code>PUBLIC_GISCUS_REPO_ID</code>, <code>PUBLIC_GISCUS_CATEGORY_ID</code>
        값을 GitHub Pages 빌드 환경에 추가하세요.
      </p>
    )
  }
</section>
